   "date": "2026-03-05",
   "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/CHRG-119shrg64619/html/CHRG-119shrg64619.htm",
   "text": "Again, as I said in my remarks, the entire AI tech stack advancing America's leadership in chips, both in manufacturing and at the critical edge of next generation chips, will be a high priority for us. And I intend to work with this committee and Congress to make sure, whatever resources you provide that we use it most effectively to make that happen.",
