   "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/CHRG-119shrg64619/html/CHRG-119shrg64619.htm",
   "text": "Senator, thank you for that question. As I said in my opening remarks, I'm fully committed to helping this deliver on the President's AI action plan. As far as NIST swimlane in this is concerned, it has a very specific expertise and swimlane, and that is to be the gold standard of the measurement science behind AI. And the AI action plan clearly lays out that all NIST should do is really focus on that and then focus on providing frameworks that other agencies can use according to their mission relevance and what they wish to do out of it.",
